From d7cc7409690b8cb8ffb6cb6c485d8e30febe1977 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: frogro <frank.grootens@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:32:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH RFC 06/22] thunderbolt: associate Apple native PCIe hosts and
 forward topology events

Retain tested storage snapshot including host lifecycle ordering and NHI guard. Based in part on DjDeveloperr 8904429ab5cc; original mail preserved. Test49 ACK instrumentation is kept outside the functional source.

Consolidation is AI-assisted. No new upstream endorsement or Signed-off-by is asserted.
---
